{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_05_beg",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_05",
  "title": "各抒己見",
  "storyCode": "GT-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9c49c54e4877754ea9193d6957895cef19bf8ebe1c2e13088eb2bf9690814a5b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "果然只有這個洞口可以出入，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。洞窟裡面雖然有很多岔路，不過村裡的大人帶我來過幾次，包括繼任村長那天......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那個，不知道是不是我的錯覺，那邊，森林裡面的喊聲是不是更多了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "再拖延下去，情況只會更加惡化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "可蘿爾，你知道山洞中的道路，我想讓你馬上進入洞窟，沿著暗道去提前拿到寶藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？你是要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我留在這個洞口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "唉？可蘿爾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要一個人面對那麼多的賞金獵人？太危險了！你，你這樣會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "如果不能幫你拿到寶藏，我既對不起村子，也辜負了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......可我不想失去你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡，這裡也不是你該逞英雄的場合......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "逞英雄又有什麼不好呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "“即便心臟被敵寇的利刃刺穿，國王的騎兵亦不解下手中長槍。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我絕不會在這裡逃走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格拉尼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "而且可蘿爾，這不只是我一個人的戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "你也有你的戰鬥。也許你會因此遭遇危險，但只要能讓這片土地回歸平靜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我們就必須去做這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "寶藏那邊就交給你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是......我一個人的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "寶藏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "相信我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "何況，我一定會照顧好你的。在廣場救下你之後我就已經下定決心，絕不會讓任何人再從你這奪走什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "哪怕只是根頭髮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你明明還是一個小孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我可不是什麼......我只是個子不高而已啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯，我會和你一起行動的，格拉尼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該死的白面具，怎麼連你們都要來礙事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "烏合之眾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "沒有資格和我們爭奪寶藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？你在說什麼？這裡早就被我們占下來了，你們還是夾著尾巴滾蛋吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "（這個角度能恰好看到南面的戰場，看來賞金獵人和整合運動已經展開了混戰。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "（接下來，無論哪一方的人接近這個洞口，我只要——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "趁他們在那邊打成一團，我們衝進去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，有個小個子站在那裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "沒人可以通過這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕哇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "你們，全都給我讓開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "我現在心情很差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
